artifact_bytes_provenance=trivy.stdout.log line 36 ('... (3496 bytes)'), scope_finish's own stat -c%s of the file it had just written. One measurement cited twice: every document carrying this size cites that line rather than measuring again (AAP 0.6.4)
artifact_bytes_expected=3496
