artifact_bytes_comparison=expected 3496, observed 3496, equal - and equal to the size the inherited record measured for an independent invocation of the same runner against the same pinned tree
artifact_format=native JSON, SchemaVersion 2
artifact_shape=native: it carries no version '2.1.0' with a runs array, so it routes to the trivy native adapter rather than to the shared SARIF adapter
artifact_shape_verified=the artifact carries no 'version' key equal to '2.1.0' and no 'runs' array, and normalize.shape.route_artifact routed it to the trivy native adapter. The mandated negative direction holds: a native artifact does not route to the SARIF adapter, which would have produced an empty result set indistinguishable from a clean scan
