sections_sum_identity=Vulnerabilities + Secrets + Misconfigurations equals the trivy record count, which must equal trivy's parsed + rejected in harness/artifacts/logs/normalize-run.json (AAP 0.5.4). Observed: 0 + 0 + 3 = 3
